    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_723a9d0b",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: for_my_haters_kill_yo_self_bitch; hasOverallIntent: Abusive; overall-intent-description: The image displays a handgun with the text 'for my haters' at the top and 'kill yo self bitch!' at the bottom. This juxtaposition of a firearm with violent, threatening language is intended to convey a message of retaliation and aggression toward critics or detractors. The overall intent is abusive, as it uses graphic imagery and explicit, hostile language to threaten and intimidate those who oppose or criticize the creator. The meme does not target any specific protected group based on race, gender, religion, or other characteristics, but rather uses a general, aggressive tone directed at 'haters' — a broad term for critics. The intent is to assert dominance and provoke fear or submission from those who disapprove, using the visual of a weapon to amplify the threat. This is a form of verbal and visual abuse, not targeted at a specific community, but still harmful and potentially dangerous due to its violent content and tone.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_c1826891"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
