      "instance_name": "self_harm_threat",
      "label": "Self-Harm Threat",
      "description": "The phrase 'kill yo self bitch!' is a violent, threatening statement that implies self-harm or suicide as a response to criticism. This is a form of verbal abuse and intimidation, often used to provoke fear or submission. It is not a literal call to action but a rhetorical device to assert dominance and express anger toward critics.",
