      "instance_name": "verbal_abuse",
      "label": "Verbal Abuse",
      "description": "The text 'kill yo self bitch!' is an example of verbal abuse, which involves the use of threatening, insulting, or demeaning language to harm or intimidate others. This type of abuse is often used to assert power or control over a target, and it can be psychologically damaging. The meme uses this form of abuse to convey a message of aggression and retaliation toward critics.",
