      "instance_name": "mapping_for_my_haters",
      "label": "The handgun is mapped as a symbol for retaliation against haters",
      "description": "The text 'for my haters' is positioned above the handgun, creating an analogical mapping where the handgun visually represents the retaliatory threat directed at critics. The weapon serves as a symbolic manifestation of the aggressive intent expressed in the text, mapping the abstract concept of 'hater' onto the concrete visual of the firearm as a tool of retribution.",
