      "label": "The handgun is mapped as the instrument of the self-harm threat",
      "description": "The text 'kill yo self bitch!' at the bottom is juxtaposed with the handgun, establishing an analogical mapping where the firearm is visually identified as the instrument through which the self-harm threat is to be carried out. The gun's presence amplifies the violent intent of the text, mapping the verbal threat onto the visual object as its literal or symbolic executor.",
